<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Equipment Return Reminder - {{appName}}</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        .container {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #ff9800;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #ff9800;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .reminder-title {
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #333;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .alert-box {
            background: #fff3cd;
            border-left: 4px solid #ff9800;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .alert-title {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #856404;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .equipment-info {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .info-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            padding: 5px 0;
        }
        .info-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #555;
        }
        .info-value {
            color: #333;
        }
        .equipment-name {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #ff9800;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .important-notice {
            background: #f8d7da;
            border-left: 4px solid #dc3545;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .notice-title {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #721c24;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .notice-text {
            color: #721c24;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .action-box {
            background: #e7f3ff;
            border-left: 4px solid #007bff;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .action-title {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #007bff;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #dee2e6;
            color: #6c757d;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .footer a {
            color: #007bff;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .footer a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            body {
                padding: 10px;
            }
            .container {
                padding: 20px;
            }
            .info-row {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            .info-label {
                margin-bottom: 5px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo">{{appName}}</div>
            <h1 class="reminder-title">Equipment Return Reminder</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="alert-box">
            <div class="alert-title">⏰ Rental Period Ended</div>
            <p style="color: #856404; margin: 0;">
                Your equipment rental period has ended. Please return the equipment to the counter as soon as possible.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="equipment-info">
            <div class="equipment-name">{{equipmentName}}</div>
            <div class="info-row">
                <span class="info-label">Quantity:</span>
                <span class="info-value">{{quantity}} item(s)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="info-row">
                <span class="info-label">Rental End Time:</span>
                <span class="info-value">{{rentalEndTime}}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="important-notice">
            <div class="notice-title">⚠️ Important Notice</div>
            <p class="notice-text">
                Please return the rented equipment to the counter immediately. 
                The equipment availability has been restored in our system, and other customers may now book it.
            </p>
            <p class="notice-text">
                Failure to return equipment on time may result in additional charges or restrictions on future rentals.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="action-box">
            <div class="action-title">What to do next?</div>
            <p style="color: #007bff; margin: 0;">
                Please visit our facility and return the equipment to the counter. 
                Our staff will be happy to assist you.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>Thank you for choosing {{appName}}!</p>
            <p>If you have any questions, please contact us at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a></p>
            <p>Visit us at <a href="{{appUrl}}">{{appUrl}}</a></p>
            <p style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #999;">
                This is an automated reminder. Please return the equipment promptly.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

